# checks that a "From " line is removed when adding mail, no matter
# where it is in the header.
#
# this should not really be necessary, but it can be. in particular,
# "From " lines have been known to appear after (some) Received fields.
depends empty-inbox
send 10
a append INBOX () {203+}
From arnt@oryx.com
From: Arnt Gulbrandsen <arnt@oryx.com>
From arnt@oryx.com
To: Arnt Gulbrandsen <arnt@oryx.com>
From arnt@oryx.com
Date: Thu, 13 May 2004 14:28:51 +0200
From arnt@oryx.com

asdf
receive 4
* 1 EXISTS
* 1 RECENT
* OK [UIDNEXT 2] next uid
a OK [APPENDUID 1 1] done
send 1
b fetch 1 body.peek[]
receive 8
* 1 FETCH (BODY[] {125}
From: Arnt Gulbrandsen <arnt@oryx.com>
To: Arnt Gulbrandsen <arnt@oryx.com>
Date: Thu, 13 May 2004 14:28:51 +0200

asdf
)
b OK done
end
